# Shadow weapons (ShadowWeapon): at Grand Master Ramos, a level 20 human fighter holding a
# C-grade exchange coupon is offered the C-grade multisell. Expectations are the reference
# trace's (ShadowWeapon.onTalk).
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/shadow_weapon_c.golden
character Shadow 20
hold 8870 1
script script.feature.ShadowWeapon
item 8869 8870
page villagemaster/30373.htm
page script/feature/ShadowWeapon/
npc ramos 30373 VillageMasterFighter 10 0 0

action ramos
action ramos
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=ramos item=0 page=villagemaster/30373.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{ramos}_Quest ShadowWeapon
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=ramos item=0 html="<html><body>\nA Shadow Weapon is a special weapon that is made in cooperation between the Ivory Tower and the Black Anvil Guild. It is created by magically projecting the power of a weapon onto another catalytic object. While that means that it can only be used while the magic charge remains, it has made it possible to mass produce projectile weapons.<br>\nIts performance is no different than if you used the original weapon, except that it cannot possess the special ability to absorb souls or refine through a Stone of Life. Also, although it acts as a weapon, it is actually in the magic category -- once opened, it cannot be passed on to someone else. Consider it an aid on your new path until you lay your hands on some real weapons.<br>\nIf you have a Shadow Weapon exchange coupon, you can receive a Shadow Weapon right for you.<br>\n<a action=\"bypass -h npc_{ramos}_multisell 306893002\">Give the Shadow Weapon exchange coupon.</a>\n</body></html>\n"
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
